OL,3,GNEWSABoxing champion supports
OL,4,Aanti-knife crime event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boxing event aimed at turning young
OL,7,Fpeople away from knife crime has been
OL,8,Fsupported by a former champion.
OL,10,FThe fight night at Venue Central in
OL,11,FLuton on Saturday was backed by former
OL,12,FBritish, Commonwealth and European
OL,13,Flightweight champion Billy Schwer.
OL,15,FHe said he was glad to support his home
OL,16,Ftown and "a great cause".
OL,18,FAttendee and former town mayor,
OL,19,FMohammed Riaz, said the core motto of
OL,20,Fthe event was "knives down, gloves up".
